<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <!-- Question 16: Demonstrating URI encoding -->
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Q16 - URI Encoding</title>
</head>
<body>

    <h1>URI Encoding Example</h1>

    <p>Original URL (contains spaces and an unencoded &amp; that a browser may misread):</p>
    <p>https://example.com/search?query=HTML & CSS</p>

    <!-- The space character is encoded as %20 so the URL is valid and unambiguous.
         Encoding spaces this way avoids the browser or server misinterpreting the URL. -->
    <p>Correctly encoded URL:</p>
    <a href="https://example.com/search?query=HTML%20&%20CSS">
        https://example.com/search?query=HTML%20&%20CSS
    </a>

</body>
</html>
